  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Appraisal of the NDC-P Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the appraisal is a final quality assurance check of the underlying documentation and of the design of the proposed new phase of Danish support to Nationally Determined Contributions -Partnership 2020-22. Particularly, to assess if the quality and feasibility of the programme design, procedures for risk management and documentation are relevant and fit to produce the expected results in an effective, efficient and sustainable manner, and make recommendations for necessary adjustments or improvements, if needed.</narrative>
  </description>
